=== efiprobe v2: guided UEFI input mapping ===
firmware: Valve rev 0x10033, UEFI 2.70
SimplePointer handles   : 2
AbsolutePointer handles : 1
  AbsolutePointer[0]: x 0..65536, y 0..65536, z 0..65536, attrs 0x0
  SimplePointer[0]: resolution x 65536 y 65536 z 65536 counts/mm, buttons L:true R:true
  SimplePointer[1]: resolution x 8 y 8 z 8 counts/mm, buttons L:true R:true

30 steps, 6s each, then 20s free-form: about 200s total.
Press the named control when asked. If you do not have it, or it
does nothing, just wait: '(nothing)' is a useful result too.
There is no way to quit early; power off if you need to stop.

